<!-- $title = Volunteers - Enslain Metal Merch-->
<!-- $volunteersAriaCurrent = aria-current="page"-->
<!-- @include "partials/_header.kit" -->
<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>Come Sling Merch With Us!</h1>
            <p>At Enslain, our crew is our life blood.</p>
            <p>We’re always looking to build our team with like-minded folks who are passionate about being part of the live music scene! We’re a fun-loving crew who don’t take ourselves too seriously, except when it comes to getting the job done.</p>
            <p>All our crew members get to decide which gigs they’re interested in participating in: do you only want to work at gigs in your city? Do you love volunteering at festivals and want to be on the crew that has the most fun? Does touring the world sound fun? Let’s make it happen!</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="img-container"><img src="/assets/img/content/steelfest-2023--resized.jpg" alt=""></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="subsection">
          <div class="grid--two-col">
            <div class="text-container">
              <h2>The Perks of Working With Enslain</h2>
              <ul class="volunteer-perks">
                <li>Lorem ipsum</li> 
                <li>dolor sit amet </li>
                <li>consectetur adipisicing elit </li>
                <li>Velit odit magnam </li>
                <li>ducimus aut hic </li>
                <li>nesciunt libero similique</li>
                <li>inventore corporis itaque</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="text-container">
              <h2>Sound good?</h2>
              <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Cumque, eos cum voluptatibus dolor molestiae eveniet harum perspiciatis officiis modi necessitatibus non expedita labore rem laboriosam optio magni laudantium voluptatem amet.</p>
              <a href="/contact/" class="button">Join us!</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subsection">
          <figure class="img-container img-container--banner">
            <img src="/assets/img/content/yle-img--resized-2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
